         binary-less host for off-editor unit testing of eviction, multi-subscriber cursors, and the JSON
         render. It references GodotLogCollector + GodotLogEntry + BridgeInstanceLock (state-string
         constants only) — all already linked above (P4.7 + P1.4). The SSE/poll HTTP routes live in
         BridgeHttpServer (linked above) and are exercised by the BridgeEventsHttpTests integration test. -->
    <Compile Include="..\Editor\Bridge\BridgeEventSource.cs" Link="Source\BridgeEventSource.cs" />
    <!-- P2.1 — tool dispatch spine. BridgeRequestBody + BridgeEnvelope + ToolDispatchResult +
